  {
   "where": "modules.M04[0].body",
   "group": "M04",
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Scorpio season has long been read as a time for depth and turning inward, and a few small rituals make room for it:\n\nAn evening with no plans, a candle lit, your phone in another room.\n\nOne thing you are ready to let go of, written down, then closed in a notebook.\n\nBlack tourmaline kept close, on your wrist or your altar, as a reminder of what is yours to tend.",
